Notice on External Dependencies & Firmware Assets:
- This repository's original C SDK code, Python tooling, and technical
  documentation are licensed under the MIT License above.
- `tools/vendor/pmca/` bundles a minimal MIT-licensed USB/Senser subset
  extracted from `ma1co/Sony-PMCA-RE` (Copyright (c) 2015 ma1co); see
  `tools/vendor/pmca/LICENSE-MIT.txt` and `tools/vendor/pmca/README.md`.
- As a convenience for Windows users, `tools/win_driver/wdi-simple.exe` is
  bundled as an independent CLI helper compiled from `pbatard/libwdi` (LGPL-3.0)
  with embedded `libusb-win32` (GPL-3.0/LGPL-3.0); see `tools/win_driver/README.md`
  and `tools/win_driver/LICENSE-LGPL-3.0.txt` for license details and source.
- This repository does NOT distribute any Sony firmware binaries, fonts,
  proprietary shared libraries, or third-party PolyForm code.
- Building and deploying onto real hardware requires the user's own legally
  obtained A7R3 v3.10 runtime libraries and external USB transport tools
  (see CREDITS.md and docs/TOOLS_AND_BUILD.md).
